Description: Eliminates library-size dropout confounding and cross-signature overlap via logistic residualization and constrained Gram-Schmidt orthogonalization, coupled with RcppArmadillo-accelerated UMAP-free diffusion geodesic pseudotime inference and mixed-effect GAM dynamic gene testing for cancer immunology single-cell data.
